---
kind: lore
id: news
title: Pell's news at breakfast
---
/* Side remarks after the morning card (`also`): they ride along after the
routine instead of replacing it. Each plays once per run. */

<beat id="lanternDone" on="dayStart" also priority="10" title="The lantern is done" when="quest.festivalLantern.state == 'complete' && run.day <= 5">
  ::actor{character="pell" anchor="left" action="fadeInUp"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The lantern hangs from the beam over the counter, turning slowly in the draught from the door.
  @pell{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: That will float. That will float all the way to the lighthouse.
  ::actor{character="pell" action="fadeOut"}
</beat>

<beat id="theoCameBy" on="dayStart" also title="Thursday — the morning after" when="run.day == 4 && quest.theoLighthouse.state == 'failed'">
  ::bg{location="lantern_shop" time="morning"}
  ::actor{character="pell" anchor="left" action="fadeInUp"}
  @pell{code="0010" emotion="teasing"}: The Maddox boy came by at seven. Didn't buy anything. Stood there looking at the glue.
  @pell{code="0020"}: Asked if you were feeling all right. Said you'd "had a lot on" last night.
  @sol{code="0010" mono}: Wednesday. Low tide. I said I'd be there.
  @pell{code="0030" emotion="sad"}: Whatever you did, love, go and undo it before Friday. Boys on this coast hold a grudge longer than a tide table.
  ::set{run.aff.theo -= 2}
  ::actor{character="pell" action="fadeOut"}
</beat>
